# data/index.sqlite3 is a derived cache of vault/, not source of truth - it's rebuilt from
# vault markdown via `investor_intel reindex` at the start of every collect/analyze/web-research
# run. Committing this binary file caused unresolvable git merge conflicts whenever more than
# one environment (GitHub Actions + multiple local machines) wrote to this branch on the same
# day. See vault/00_System/Runbook.md "인덱스 복구".
data/index.sqlite3
data/sec_company_tickers.json

# data/search_index.sqlite3 (BM25/vector index) is likewise a derived cache, rebuilt whole
# from vault/20_Knowledge via `investor_intel index build`. 2026-08-25: at 4.3GB it is also
# far past any size git can carry - same reasoning as data/index.sqlite3 above.
data/search_index.sqlite3
data/embedding_cache.sqlite3
